# Run artifacts. Checkpoints and per-combo plots are large and regenerable, so
# they stay out -- but the per-run metrics and predictions do NOT. They are the
# input to every statistical test in make_significance.py, they total under
# 100 MB across a full sweep, and excluding them means a lost training box costs
# a ~20-hour retrain to recompute a p-value.
#
# Directories must be re-included before the files inside them: git will not
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
outputs/**
!outputs/**/
!outputs/full/*/metrics.json
!outputs/full/*/predictions.csv
!outputs/full/*/predictions_norm.csv
!outputs/full/*/train.log
!outputs/full/*/inference.log
# weight_decay_exempt=false ablation (util/wd_ablation.sh). Small, and it is the
# evidence that the exemption did NOT cause Mamba's regression -- worth keeping
# so the conclusion can be rechecked without 40 minutes of GPU.
!outputs/wd_ablation/*/metrics.json
!outputs/wd_ablation/*.log
!outputs/wd_ablation/README.md
# Corrected-cohort reruns (918 lanes / 4,590 targets). Kept SEPARATE from
# outputs/full so the pre-correction artifacts survive as the evidence for the
# Procedia correction -- RESULTS_STATUS.md says to keep both, and outputs/full
# is the only tracked copy in this clone. Same file whitelist as outputs/full.
!outputs/full_corrected/*/metrics.json
!outputs/full_corrected/*/predictions.csv
!outputs/full_corrected/*/predictions_norm.csv
!outputs/full_corrected/*/train.log
!outputs/full_corrected/*/inference.log
!outputs/full_corrected/*/run.log
!outputs/full_corrected/README.md

# macOS Finder / iCloud copy-on-write duplicate files (e.g. "file 2.py", "AUTHORS 2")
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
# Excel / Office lock files
~$*
paper/
.venv-fair/

# Isolated CPU environment for model regression checks
.venv-model-audit/
